{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118367","id":3511570685,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RTlD9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118367","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118367.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118367.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118367","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118367/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118367/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118367/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f12e7ff5d0bb860bd08cb40c1c95aaeb7ca9ae19","number":118367,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"GDScript: Add compiled bytecode export option","user":{"login":"cheatdeveloper73","id":63566756,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTY2NzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63566756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73","html_url":"https://github.com/cheatdeveloper73","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheatdeveloper73/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\nThis restores compiled GDScript export for the 4.x line by serializing compiled scripts to `.gdb` files during export and loading those compiled assets back through the GDScript cache/resource loader path at runtime.\n\nThis branch is scoped to the compiled export/load path only:\n- export preset wiring for compiled script output\n- `.gdb` serialization and deserialization for compiled GDScript\n- `.gdb` loading support in the GDScript cache/resource loader flow\n- bytecode dump support for exported scripts\n- regression coverage for remap loading and serializer roundtrip behavior\n\n## Why\nThis is not being proposed as a brand-new workflow.\n\nGodot 3.x exposed a \"compiled bytecode\" export option, but in Godot 4.x that workflow was effectively gone. On March 17, 2022, issue `#59241` reported that the option still existed in 4.0, but exported projects continued to ship original `.gd` files instead of compiled script assets:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59241\n\nIn the discussion on that issue, `vnen` explained two important points:\n- the old 3.x `.gdc` path was essentially tokenized source, not a fully compiled script representation\n- the better direction for 4.x was an intermediate representation that stores scripts already tokenized, parsed, and compiled in the export\n\nRelevant maintainer discussion:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59241#issuecomment-1089458703\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59241#issuecomment-1384520401\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/59241#issuecomment-1386122358\n\nRelated proposal:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8605\n\nThis change is meant to restore compiled-script export for 4.x in that direction: exported projects ship runnable compiled script data instead of loadable plaintext `.gd` sources.\n\nThis is not intended as DRM or a security boundary. The goal is to restore a compiled export workflow so projects can distribute runnable scripts without also shipping directly reusable source text in the exported pack.\n\n## Testing\n- `git diff --check`\n- added a regression test for `.gdb` remap loading, self references, and typed arrays\n- added a regression test for direct bytecode serializer roundtrip runtime and dump preservation\n- built Windows editor, `template_debug`, and `template_release` from this branch\n- verified a real exported project ran correctly with bytecode export enabled on a fresh 4.6.1-based build\n- mounted the exported `.pck` with the built engine and verified it contained `79` `.gdb` files and `0` `.gd` files when enumerated through Godot's own pack loader\n\n## Upstream note\nThis should be framed upstream as restoration of a missing 3.x export workflow for the 4.x GDScript pipeline, not as an unrelated new feature. That said, it still changes current 4.x export behavior, so the corresponding proposal discussion is linked above.\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T01:28:30Z